  "utterances": [
    {
      "speaker": "spk_2",
      "role": "PROSPECT",
      "start": 0.4,
      "end": 2.43,
      "text": "Corvane Logistics, this is Yara."
    },
    {
      "speaker": "spk_1",
      "role": "REP",
      "start": 3.46,
      "end": 11.19,
      "text": "Hi Yara, it's Sam from Vantrellis. I saw your team finished the Harlow Street job last week. How did that land?"
    },
    {
      "speaker": "spk_2",
      "role": "PROSPECT",
      "start": 12.16,
      "end": 17.11,
      "text": "Ha, it was a sprint, but we got there. Thanks for asking."
    },
    {
      "speaker": "spk_1",
      "role": "REP",
      "start": 18.04,
      "end": 31.32,
      "text": "I was hoping to use our thirty minutes to understand how dispatch works for you today, share what similar teams do, and then decide together if a next step makes sense. Anything you'd add to that?"
    },
    {
      "speaker": "spk_2",
      "role": "PROSPECT",
      "start": 32.36,
      "end": 35.65,
      "text": "No, that works. Leave some time for pricing."
    },
    {
      "speaker": "spk_1",
      "role": "REP",
      "start": 36.21,
      "end": 39.12,
      "text": "What's the biggest challenge with dispatch right now?"
    },
    {
      "speaker": "spk_2",
      "role": "PROSPECT",
      "start": 39.58,
      "end": 45.36,
      "text": "It takes too long. Our dispatcher spends most of every Friday afternoon on it."
    },
    {
      "speaker": "spk_1",
      "role": "REP",
      "start": 45.95,
      "end": 49.98,
      "text": "What would success look like by the end of the quarter?"
    },
    {
      "speaker": "spk_2",
      "role": "PROSPECT",
      "start": 50.55,
      "end": 55.5,
      "text": "Get dispatch down to thirty minutes a day, and zero missed pickups."
    },
    {
      "speaker": "spk_1",
      "role": "REP",
      "start": 56.49,
      "end": 66.44,
      "text": "Let me make sure I have this right. Our dispatcher spends most of every Friday afternoon on dispatching drivers, and things still slip. Did I miss anything?"
    },
    {
      "speaker": "spk_2",
      "role": "PROSPECT",
      "start": 67.0,
      "end": 68.61,
      "text": "No, that's it exactly."
    },
    {
      "speaker": "spk_1",
      "role": "REP",
      "start": 69.31,
      "end": 82.97,
      "text": "You said our dispatcher spends most of every Friday afternoon on dispatching drivers. With us, drivers confirm every change from their phone. That's the part that would have caught it when we missed three pickups in August."
    },
    {
      "speaker": "spk_2",
      "role": "PROSPECT",
      "start": 83.97,
      "end": 86.84,
      "text": "Okay. What does something like that cost?"
    },
    {
      "speaker": "spk_1",
      "role": "REP",
      "start": 87.99,
      "end": 97.94,
      "text": "It's twenty-four thousand dollars a year. But honestly, if you sign this month I can take twenty percent off, so it's really a lot less than that."
    },
    {
      "speaker": "spk_2",
      "role": "PROSPECT",
      "start": 98.38,
      "end": 101.24,
      "text": "Okay. I'll have to think about it."
    },
    {
      "speaker": "spk_1",
      "role": "REP",
      "start": 102.06,
      "end": 105.72,
      "text": "Are you the one who makes the call on this?"
    },
    {
      "speaker": "spk_2",
      "role": "PROSPECT",
      "start": 106.18,
      "end": 107.79,
      "text": "Me and Dana, mostly."
    },
    {
      "speaker": "spk_1",
      "role": "REP",
      "start": 108.75,
      "end": 112.78,
      "text": "Does what you've seen so far make sense for your team?"
    },
    {
      "speaker": "spk_2",
      "role": "PROSPECT",
      "start": 113.62,
      "end": 118.57,
      "text": "Can you just send me some info and I'll look it over?"
    },
    {
      "speaker": "spk_1",
      "role": "REP",
      "start": 119.56,
      "end": 125.43,
      "text": "Happy to. So I send the right thing, what would you need to see in it?"
    },
    {
      "speaker": "spk_2",
      "role": "PROSPECT",
      "start": 125.92,
      "end": 131.71,
      "text": "Probably proof it works with our current tools, and something I can show Dana."
    },
    {
      "speaker": "spk_1",
      "role": "REP",
      "start": 132.77,
      "end": 134.57,
      "text": "Let's reconnect sometime next week."
    },
    {
      "speaker": "spk_2",
      "role": "PROSPECT",
      "start": 135.69,
      "end": 136.89,
      "text": "Sure, sounds good."
    },
    {
      "speaker": "spk_1",
      "role": "REP",
      "start": 137.57,
      "end": 139.74,
      "text": "Thanks Yara, really appreciate the time."
    },
    {
      "speaker": "spk_2",
      "role": "PROSPECT",
      "start": 140.84,
      "end": 141.62,
      "text": "Thanks, bye."
    }
  ],
